      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harrisville%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Robert Reed opened the first tavern in 1797 south of present Harrisville, the earliest between Pittsburgh and Franklin.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
        15
